@startuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
scale max 800 width
skinparam padding 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

title 3.1 — Market-Localized Promotional Content Generation: Caption Matrix & Approval

actor Operator as O
participant "ContentStudio\nView" as UI
participant "Content\nController" as CC
participant "ContentGeneration\nService" as CGS
participant "ContentApproval\nService" as CAS
participant "AIInferenceGateway\nService" as GW
participant "FastAPI\n(LangGraph Agent)" as FP
participant "tbl_localized_\npromotional_content" as DB

== 1. Content Generation (on mount) ==

O -> UI: Navigate to Content Studio\n(market selected)
UI -> CC: POST /api/content/generate\n{market, businessName, description,\ncategories, trend} ?profileId

alt profileId provided
  CC -> CGS: generate(req, profileId)
  CGS -> CGS: Load BusinessProfile\n(override request fields: services, uvp, uniquenessScore)
else no profileId
  CC -> CGS: generate(req)\n(use request body as-is)
end

CGS -> CGS: buildForecastContext()\n(query ForecastResult + MarketScore\nfrom Module 2 tables)
CGS -> CGS: build snake_case payload\n(business_name, target_market,\nmarket_category, forecast_context, ...)

CGS -> GW: generateCaption(payload)
GW -> FP: POST /internal/generation/caption\n(CaptionInputClass)

note right of FP
  LangGraph StateGraph(SocialAgentState):
  Node 1 — analyze_services:
    relevant vs. extra services
  Node 2 — generate_platform_captions:
    3 archetypes × 3 platforms
    (Witty / Formal / Storytelling)
    × (Instagram / TikTok / Facebook)
  cultural_research.research_market()
    supplies context (SerpAPI or template)
  get_platform_guides() adds visual tips;
    Naver = 2 hardcoded Korean blog options
end note

alt LLM available
  FP --> GW: {market, framework, captions, source: "groq"}
else LLM unavailable
  FP --> GW: {captions: fallback templates, source: "fallback"}
end

GW --> CGS: raw map
CGS -> CGS: deserialize → ContentResponseDto

alt profileId present
  CGS -> DB: INSERT 4 rows\n(instagram, tiktok, facebook, naver)\napproval_status = false
end

CGS --> CC: ContentResponseDto
CC --> UI: ContentResponseDto\n{market, captions, source}
UI -> UI: Render AIContentMatrixPanel\n3 platform tabs × 3 archetype cards

== 2. Content Approval (fire-and-forget) ==

O -> UI: Click "Approve" on one\ncaption per platform
UI ->> CC: POST /api/content/approve\n{market} ?profileId [non-blocking]

CC -> CAS: approveForMarket(profileId, market)
CAS -> DB: UPDATE approval_status = true\nSET approved_at = now()\nWHERE (business_profile_id, selected_market)

note right of DB
  This approval gate enables
  Submodule 3.2 Creative Direction.
  hasApprovedContent() checks this
  flag before generating visual direction.
end note

DB --> CAS: updated rows
CAS --> CC: List<UUID> approvedIds
CC --> UI: {approvedIds, market, count}

@enduml
